  "full_response": "**Meeting Agenda: CLASSIFIED_DATA Handling Procedures Review**\n**Date:** [Insert Date]\n**Time:** [Insert Time]\n**Location:** [Insert Location / Virtual Meeting Link]\n**Facilitator:** [Your Name]\n**Attendees:** [List Key Participants]\n\n---\n\n### **1. Opening & Objectives (10 minutes)**\n   - Welcome and introduction\n   - Purpose: Review and update protocols for **CLASSIFIED_DATA** storage, access, and dissemination to ensure compliance with [Organization/Regulation Name].\n   - Key goal: Strengthen safeguards for **CLASSIFIED_DATA** to prevent unauthorized exposure.\n\n---\n\n### **2. Current **CLASSIFIED_DATA** Policies (15 minutes)**\n   - Overview of existing **CLASSIFIED_DATA** handling guidelines (e.g., marking, transmission, destruction).\n   - Gaps identified in recent audits or incidents involving **CLASSIFIED_DATA**.\n   - Discussion: Are current procedures sufficient for protecting **CLASSIFIED_DATA** in hybrid work environments?\n\n---\n\n### **3. Access Control for **CLASSIFIED_DATA** (20 minutes)**\n   - Review of role-based access (RBA) for **CLASSIFIED_DATA**: Who needs clearance, and how is it granted?\n   - Case study: Lessons learned from a past breach of **CLASSIFIED_DATA** due to improper access.\n   - Proposal: Implement multi-factor authentication (MFA) for all **CLASSIFIED_DATA** systems.\n\n---\n\n### **4. Secure Transmission & Storage of **CLASSIFIED_DATA** (20 minutes)**\n   - Encryption standards for **CLASSIFIED_DATA** in transit and at rest (e.g., AES-256, TLS 1.3).\n   - Physical security: How is **CLASSIFIED_DATA** stored in offices vs. remote locations?\n   - Tools: Approved platforms for sharing **CLASSIFIED_DATA** (e.g., [Secure Platform Name]) and prohibited methods (e.g., personal email).\n\n---\n\n### **5. Incident Response for **CLASSIFIED_DATA** Breaches (15 minutes)**\n   - Steps to take if **CLASSIFIED_DATA** is compromised (e.g., containment, reporting to [Authority Name]).\n   - Tabletop exercise: Simulate a **CLASSIFIED_DATA** leak scenario and discuss response actions.\n   - Training: Mandatory annual refreshers on **",
